#. comic269 panel p5
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddmood.gif
#: kidradd/comic269.htm:295
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic269#p5.1"
msgid "But the difference is: For the first time ever, it wasn't part of a game. Until today, I never killed anybody for real."
